Package: indonesiaFootballScoutR
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Football Player Scouting in Indonesia
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Tio", "Anta Wibawa", email = "tio158@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides tools to scrape, clean, and analyze football player data
    from Indonesian leagues and perform similarity-based scouting
    analysis using standardized numeric features. The similarity
    approach follows common vector-space methods as described in
    Manning et al. (2008, ISBN:9780521865715) and Salton et al. (1975,
    <doi:10.1145/361219.361220>).
